/// M08 CORE-026 "http dispatch: roots green, eighteen assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/http_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledHTTP (L17-233).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/http/main.can (read at
/// L46, staged as src/main.can at L50); every count pin below grounds an
/// assert arm in that fixture (handle 2, submit 2, json_ok 1, search 2,
/// inspect 1, tagged 1, upload 2, stream_echo 1, events 1, attach 1,
/// peer 1, wrapped 1, responses 1, mounted 1, main 1; total 18).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 18 roots, grounded per function in the main.can fixture,
/// with supplied-completion and real-can evidence present.
/// The live dispatch replies live in core-026-http-semantics.can; the
/// production process shape lives in core-026-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); dispatch variants
/// (GET cardinality/encoding, POST JSON/media/malformed, form cases,
/// generic/wrapped routes, 404/405 with Allow, method routes,
/// upload/echo/events/multipart) live in the http-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_TSC gates the optional strict
/// tsc leg (pinned conditional in the run-shape file). Logical gates
/// SUITE/WORK/PROC and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run
/// now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L24).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case http/main-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, supplied-evidence, real-evidence,
/// handle-roots, submit-roots, json-roots, search-roots, inspect-roots,
/// tagged-roots, upload-roots, echo-roots, events-roots, attach-roots,
/// peer-roots, wrapped-roots, responses-roots, mounted-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (http_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L70-73: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L75: passed true); root-count pins
/// the eighteen roots (L75: len assertions is 18); fixture-name grounds
/// the pins in the staged fixture (L46: main.can; L50: src/main.can);
/// supplied-evidence pins supplied completion evidence (L78:
/// supplied-completion; fixture L19-25: handle stands in via when arms);
/// real-evidence pins real native evidence (L78: real-can; fixture L47
/// and L232-249: json_ok/responses run the real constructors);
/// handle-roots pins handle (fixture L15-17: method/missing, 2 roots);
/// submit-roots pins submit (fixture L32-34: created/bad, 2);
/// json-roots pins json_ok (fixture L45-46: sample, 1);
/// search-roots pins search (fixture L54-56: found/incomplete, 2);
/// inspect-roots pins inspect (fixture L69-70: path, 1);
/// tagged-roots pins tagged (fixture L91-92: sample, 1);
/// upload-roots pins upload (fixture L98-100: first/ended, 2);
/// echo-roots pins stream_echo (fixture L128-129: sample, 1);
/// events-roots pins events (fixture L164-165: sample, 1);
/// attach-roots pins attach (fixture L194-195: sample, 1);
/// peer-roots pins peer (fixture L211-212: sample, 1);
/// wrapped-roots pins wrapped (fixture L222-223: sample, 1);
/// responses-roots pins responses (fixture L230-231: sample, 1);
/// mounted-roots pins mounted (fixture L252-253: sample, 1);
/// main-roots pins main (fixture L281-282: sample, 1).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
